             rdfs:comment "A cube questionnaire has cube question." ;
             rdfs:label "has question"@en ;
             owl:inverseOf "isQuestionOf" .


###  https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKCube#hasRelatedConcept
:hasRelatedConcept rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
